{"id":"9b271ecc61952593","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-progressive-ito-data.md","title":"Progressive Measurability and the Finite-Horizon Itô Integral","display":"df-progressive-ito-data — Progressive Measurability and the Finite-Horizon Itô Integral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-progressive-ito-data","aliases":["58-df-progressive-ito-data"],"display":"df-progressive-ito-data — Progressive Measurability and the Finite-Horizon Itô Integral","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-progressive-ito-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-progressive-ito-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-progressive-ito-data — Progressive Measurability and the Finite-Horizon Itô Integral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"263379658f1ae518\" href=\"?note=263379658f1ae518\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T=\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(\\mathbb T=\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,W,t,Y\\in V\">\\(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,W,t,Y\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>过程 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\">\\(\\mathbb T\\to\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\)</span> 的逐时随机变量编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta=\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\\theta(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in\\mathbb T,\\ w\\in\\Omega\\}\">\\(H_\\theta=\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,\\theta(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in\\mathbb T,\\ w\\in\\Omega\\}\\)</span> 为其联合函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span> 只在该类型下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_t,\\lambda_t\">\\(\\mathcal L_t,\\lambda_t\\)</span>、平方范数值、时间积分值与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S\\)</span> 均取自随机积分数据依赖；简单可预见和及其有限和积分取自随机积分依赖。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_t=\\sigma_{[0,t]}(\\{(a,b)\\cap[0,t]:a,b\\in\\mathbb Q,\\ a&lt;b\\})\">\\(\\mathcal B_t=\\sigma_{[0,t]}(\\{(a,b)\\cap[0,t]:a,b\\in\\mathbb Q,\\ a&lt;b\\})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb T\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb T\\)</span>；生成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数使用内部交集定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S\\)</span> 保留两参数接口；其中样本空间从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup\\mathcal F_\\bullet(0)\">\\(\\bigcup\\mathcal F_\\bullet(0)\\)</span> 唯一恢复。该谓词不调用离散时间的二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\\Omega=\\bigcup\\mathcal F_\\bullet(0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\n\\land\\theta\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\mathbb T}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\\bigr]\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb T\\;(s\\le t\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb T\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(\nH_\\theta\\upharpoonright([0,t]\\times\\Omega);\n([0,t]\\times\\Omega,\\sigma_{[0,t]\\times\\Omega}(\\{A\\times B:A\\in\\mathcal B_t,\\ B\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t)\\})),\n(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\\Omega=\\bigcup\\mathcal F_\\bullet(0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\n\\land\\theta\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{\\mathbb T}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\\bigr]\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb T\\;(s\\le t\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb T\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\!\\left(\nH_\\theta\\upharpoonright([0,t]\\times\\Omega);\n([0,t]\\times\\Omega,\\sigma_{[0,t]\\times\\Omega}(\\{A\\times B:A\\in\\mathcal B_t,\\ B\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t)\\})),\n(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S(Y,\\theta,W,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp; t\\in\\mathbb T\\land\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H_\\theta,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb T\\times\\Omega})^\\omega\\;\\exists J\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q(n),\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J(n),Q(n),W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\!\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,Q(n)(s,w)-\\theta(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in\\mathbb T,w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\!\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(n)(w)-Y(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProgressiveItoIntegral58}_S(Y,\\theta,W,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp; t\\in\\mathbb T\\land\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ProgressivelyMeasurable}_S(\\theta,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H_\\theta,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in(\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb T\\times\\Omega})^\\omega\\;\\exists J\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q(n),\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J(n),Q(n),W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\!\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,Q(n)(s,w)-\\theta(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in\\mathbb T,w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\!\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(n)(w)-Y(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}_S(I,A,T,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\in\\mathbb T\\land A\\subseteq\\Omega\\land I\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{[0,T]}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in A\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,T]\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|I(s)(w)-I(t)(w)|&lt;\\varepsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FiniteHorizonContinuous58}_S(I,A,T,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\in\\mathbb T\\land A\\subseteq\\Omega\\land I\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^{[0,T]}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in A\\;\\forall t\\in[0,T]\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall s\\in[0,T]\\;(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|I(s)(w)-I(t)(w)|&lt;\\varepsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>逐步可测性的乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数、时间区间和样本空间均已固定。</li>\n<li>新积分关系仍由原简单 Itô 和的平方均值极限构造，只将被积函数域扩展到逐步可测的平方可积过程；不把逐步可测误写成逐点可预见。</li>\n<li>本文件没有改写原来只要求适应性的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\)</span>；与指定滤过的增量独立性通过原包已有的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S\\)</span> 明确提出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"263379658f1ae518","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}$、$\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}$、$\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}$ 取 [[../batch03/58-df-stocha